        "created_at": "2017-05-24T19:01:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Adam\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/adam/48/1946_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Adam:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Trajector wrote:</b><br><blockquote>2. Christopher says that the art on cards does go with at least the issue number from the flavor text, during the discussion about when they build Freedom Tower.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nNo, not always. We've said as much before, while they often are linked, it's not all of them.&nbsp;&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Anyway of knowing for sure when they aren't? &nbsp; I know some cards don't even reference an issue. &nbsp;</p>",
