      {
        "id": 198415,
        "name": "Braithwhite",
        "username": "Braithwhite",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/{size}/1854_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-25T11:48:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My guess is that we'll see several familiar faces, with new names. Here are my guesses!</p><p>Felicia&nbsp;</p><p>The Dreamer (likely with a new name, and far greater control)</p><p>The Idealist (we know Dr. Medico is going through hard times, what with keeping Gloomweaver imprisoned, so maybe the Southwest Sentinels have disbanded, but she seems like someone who would want to keep being a hero)</p><p>Thiago- we know he becomes Ra in tactics, perhaps in the RPG timeline, he takes on an entirely new mantle... perhaps the next Wraith or Bunker? Perhaps using elements of both of their techniques?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
