      {
        "id": 198416,
        "name": "MindWanderer",
        "username": "MindWanderer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-25T18:19:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"kitmehsu\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/kitmehsu/48/1901_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> kitmehsu:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Flight, Invulnerability, and Super Strength.&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I learned it as Flight, Invulnerability, Strength, and Speed (from the excellent comic, PS238).</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Braithwhite\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/braithwhite/48/1854_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Braithwhite:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Dreamer (likely with a new name, and far greater control)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Doesn't she still have that aneurysm? &nbsp;I don't recall anyone saying anything about that being cured. &nbsp;Not a great choice for a new team that's meant to last a while.</p>",
